sentences.text:
This Court has considered the following facts while exercising discretion in favour of the applicant :-
(i) the applicant is in jail since 07.11.2023;
(ii) investigation is over and charge-sheet is filed;
(iii) prima facie this seems to be a case of love affair;
(iv) no past antecedent is attributed to the present applicant.
6.

Hence, present application is allowed and the applicant is ordered to be released on regular bail in connection with the FIR being C.R.No.11213043230027 of 2023 registered with Patanvav Police Station, District Rajkot on executing personal bond of Rs.10,000/- (Rupees Ten thousand only) with one surety of the like amount to the satisfaction of the learned Trial Court and subject to the conditions that he shall;
[a] not take undue advantage of liberty or misuse liberty;
[b] not act in a manner injuries to the interest of the prosecution;
[c] surrender passport, if any, to the lower court within a week;
[d] not leave India without prior permission of the Sessions Judge concerned;

[e] furnish latest address of residence to the Investigating Officer and also to the Court at the time of execution of the bond and shall not change the residence without prior permission of the trial Court;
[f] mark his presence before the concerned police station in the first week of every month till the trial is over;
R/CR.MA/5663/2023 ORDER DATED: 20/04/2023 7.

